### 쿠폰 생성 - 정액 할인
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "신규 가입 5000원 할인 쿠폰",
  "type": "FIXED",
  "value": 5000,
  "minOrderAmount": 10000,
  "maxDiscountAmount": null,
  "maxIssueCount": 100,
  "expiredAt": "2026-04-06T23:59:59+09:00"
}

### 쿠폰 생성 - 정률 할인
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "VIP 10% 할인 쿠폰",
  "type": "RATE",
  "value": 10,
  "minOrderAmount": 20000,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 5000,
  "maxIssueCount": 50,
  "expiredAt": "2026-04-06T23:59:59+09:00"
}

### 쿠폰 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/coupons?page=0&size=20

### 쿠폰 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/coupons/1

### 쿠폰 발급 내역 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/coupons/1/issues?offset=0&limit=20

### 쿠폰 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/coupons/1
